# The image is built from an allowlist: the Go module, cmd/, internal/ and web/.
# internal/pdf/typstwasm/receipt.wasm must be the real file (`git lfs pull`),
# the Dockerfile fails early on an LFS pointer.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!web/

# Built or installed locally; the image builds its own.
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/playwright-report/
web/test-results/
web/**/*.tsbuildinfo
# Vite env files (web/.env, .env.local, .env.production, ...): local values
# must not reach the image's build. The production build needs none of them;
# the committed web/.env.demo is for the demo build only.
web/.env*
# WASM demo artifacts (scripts/build-wasm.sh); the production UI must not
# ship them.
web/public/app.wasm
web/public/wasm_exec.js
web/public/receipt.wasm
# Leftovers of an interrupted scripts/build-server.sh: only the placeholder
# belongs to the embed directory.
internal/webui/dist/*
!internal/webui/dist/index.html
